  "body": "**Description:**\r\nAdd `TLSA` record validation for outgoing federation connections. If `SRV` or `.well-known` points us to `synapse.example.com:8448` we would like to:\r\n\r\n1. Check if  `TLSA` record for `_8448._tcp.synapse.example.com` exists in the DNS\r\n2. Validate the `TLSA` record against the TLS certificate chain presented by the federation server\r\n\r\nDetails of the latter depend on semantics of the `TLSA` record. [swede](https://github.com/pieterlexis/swede/blob/master/swede) can be used as a reference Python implementation.\r\n\r\n* [RFC6698](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6698)\r\n* [RFC7671](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7671)\r\n* [RFC7218](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7218)",
